{"unit_id": "tag:0EZQ:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若对光滑（smooth）基变换（base change）定理或适当基变换定理（proper base change theorem）感兴趣，可以直接跳到相应的节。在本节和接下来的几节中，考虑交换图（commutative diagrams）<MATH_0001>，由概形（schemes）组成；通常假设此图（diagram）是笛卡尔（cartesian）的，即<MATH_0002>。如上的交换图（commutative diagram）给出交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0003>，由小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（sites）组成。使用记号<MATHSEG_0001>及<MATHSEG_0002>。由《景（Sites）》节<REF_0001>，得到基变换（base change）或拉回（pullback）映射（map）<MATH_0004>，对于层（sheaf）<MATH_0005>，定义在<MATH_0006>上。若<MATH_0007>是阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），定义在<MATH_0008>上，则得到导出基变换（derived base change）映射（map）<MATH_0009>，见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0002>。最后，若<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>的任意对象（object），则有基变换（base change）映射（map）<MATH_0012>，见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》注记<REF_0003>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "proper base change theorem", "target_term": "适当基变换定理"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagrams", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡尔"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "derived base change", "target_term": "导出基变换"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": 